privacy.security_desc:
We take appropriate technical and organizational measures to ensure an appropriate level of protection: TLS encryption of all connections; 
Restricting access through authentication; 
firewalls and intrusion detection; 
Regular penetration testing; 
Data backup in data centers in Germany; 
Employee training on data protection; 
Order processing contracts with all service providers.
